$ rc apps apple setup app_snap1 --no-input --project-id proj_snap --api-key sk_snap

▍ Apple configuration — Moodly (App Store)
  Signs in to App Store Connect and sets up the keys RevenueCat needs —
  nothing changes without your OK.

  App                         app_snap1
  In-app purchase key         configured       · validates App Store purchases
  App Store Connect API key   not configured   · manages products and prices
  Vendor number               not configured   · links sales reports to revenue charts

▍ Plan
· 1. Sign in to App Store Connect with your Apple Account
· 2. Verify the App Store Connect app for com.example.moodly
· 3. Create the App Store Connect API key
· 4. Look up and confirm the vendor number
· 5. Save to RevenueCat
(exit: can't prompt for Apple sign-in here (--json or --no-input): supply the Apple Account email and password with --apple-id/--apple-password (or RC_APPLE_ID/RC_APPLE_PASSWORD) and the 2FA code with --verification-code (or RC_APPLE_2FA_CODE), or run `rc apps apple setup app_snap1` in an interactive terminal)
